    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Miss Du",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_296_1",
      "text": "I don't suppose you'd believe me if I said I had nothing to do with this?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Kroos",
      "speakerId": "avg_1021_kroos2_1",
      "text": "I haven't even said anything yet."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Kroos",
      "speakerId": "avg_1021_kroos2_1",
      "text": "But put yourself in my shoes. Soon as I arrive in Shangshu, I run into someone trying to rob a friend. And now again. Would YOU believe that's a coincidence?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Kroos",
      "speakerId": "avg_1021_kroos2_1",
      "text": "Don't worry though, I'll give you plenty of time to work out your excuse."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Miss Du",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_296_1",
      "text": "Hmph."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Miss Du",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_296_1",
      "text": "Might as well save my breath, then!"
